  **SPEC-UNCERTAIN / not-yet-evaluated (return the documented nil):**
  - vlax-curve-* on ELLIPSE and SPLINE (elliptic-integral / NURBS math), and
    the arc segments of a bulged LWPOLYLINE/POLYLINE (treated as absent).
  - vlax-curve-getclosestpointtoprojection for an oblique projection plane
    (only normal ~ +Z, i.e. the identity projection, is computed).
  - vlax-typeinfo-available-p approximates "has type info" by method presence.
